Regarding the `kv_crc` value inside v2 resume tokens, it is computed as a cyclic redundancy check (CRC) of the serialized key-value pair in the resume token. The CRC is calculated using a standard CRC algorithm, such as CRC-32 or CRC-64. The resulting CRC value is then encoded into the resume token along with the serialized key-value pair.
